flowchart TD
    %% Nodes
    StartPoint(開始)
    TaskIsReviewFix{任務是否為Review}
    ReadImplementationPlan(讀取 Implementation Plan)
    CheckImplementationPlan(檢查 Implementation Plan)
    CheckImplementationIssueList(檢查是否有Implementation Issue file)
    WriteImplementationIssue(撰寫 Implementation Issue)
    ImplementationProgram(實作程式)
    PassToSystemDesignAgent(交給 System Design Agent)
    ReadReviewResult(讀取 Review Result)
    HaveConflictWith{是否與 Implementation Plan衝突}
    ProgramFix(程式修正)
    PassToCodeReviewAgent(交給 Code Review Agent)
    EndPoint(結束)

    %% Connections
    StartPoint --> ReadImplementationPlan --> TaskIsReviewFix
    TaskIsReviewFix -->|是| ReadReviewResult
    TaskIsReviewFix -->|否| CheckImplementationIssueList -->CheckImplementationPlan 
    CheckImplementationPlan -->|實作計畫有疑問| WriteImplementationIssue
    CheckImplementationPlan -->|實作計畫無疑問| ImplementationProgram --> PassToCodeReviewAgent
    
    ReadReviewResult --> HaveConflictWith
    HaveConflictWith -->|否| ProgramFix --> PassToCodeReviewAgent
    HaveConflictWith -->|是| WriteImplementationIssue
    PassToCodeReviewAgent --> EndPoint
    WriteImplementationIssue --> PassToSystemDesignAgent --> EndPoint